Saying it twice...

509
00:45:07,010 --> 00:45:08,510
2回言うの辛いよね、推しが出なかった時
Saying it twice is tough, right? When you don't get your oshi,

510
00:45:08,690 --> 00:45:11,210
本当につらい思いは忘れるよ。
you really forget how painful it is.

511
00:45:12,050 --> 00:45:15,610
でもね、あの、回して出るまで回せばね、それは出る。
But you know, if you just keep spinning until you get it, it'll come out.

512
00:45:16,970 --> 00:45:19,070
